":\"feed\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"indexed\":false,\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"maxStalenessSeconds\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"name\":\"FeedRegistered\",\"type\":\"event\"},{\"anonymous\":false,\"inputs\":[{\"indexed\":true,\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"asset\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"name\":\"FeedUnregistered\",\"type\":\"event\"},{\"anonymous\":false,\"inputs\":[{\"indexed\":true,\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"previousOwner\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"indexed\":true,\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"newOwner\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"name\":\"OwnerTransferred\",\"type\":\"event\"},{\"anonymous\":false,\"inputs\":[{\"indexed\":true,\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"sequencerFeed\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"name\":\"SequencerFeedSet\",\"type\":\"event\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"SEQUENCER_GRACE_PERIOD\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"name\":\"assetFeeds\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"contract AggregatorV3Interface\",\"name\":\"feed\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"maxStaleness\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"market\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"asset\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"name\":\"configure\",\"outputs\":[],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"factory\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"name\":\"getHistoricalPrice\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"getPrice\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"price\",\"type\":\"uint256\"},{\"internalType\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"isTrusted\",\"type\":\"bool\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"updatedAt\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"l2SequencerFeed\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"contract AggregatorV3Interface\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"name\":\"marketAssets\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"owner\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"asset\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"feedAddress\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"maxStalenessSeconds\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"name\":\"registerFeed\",\"outputs\":[],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"sequencerFeedAddress\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"name\":\"setL2SequencerFeed\",\"outputs\":[],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"newOwner\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"name\":\"transferOwner\",\"outputs\":[],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"asset\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"name\":\"unregisterFeed\",\"outputs\":[],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\"}],\"devdoc\":{\"details\":\"Implements IOracleAdapter with staleness detection, decimal normalization and an      optional L2 Sequencer Uptime Feed check (Base, OP, Arbitrum, etc.).      Feeds are registered PER ASSET by the owner via registerFeed(). The MarketFactory      calls configure(market, asset) at market creation, which records the asset for the      market. getPrice() resolves the asset's current feed dynamically, so feed updates      propagate to all existing markets automatically.      If the L2 sequencer feed is configured, getPrice() returns isTrusted=false while the      sequencer is down or during the grace period after it comes back up.\",\"kind\":\"dev\",\"methods\":{\"configure(address,address)\":{\"details\":\"Factory calls this once per market. Records the collateral asset so getPrice()      can resolve the current feed for that asset dynamically.\"},\"getHistoricalPrice(uint256)\":{\"details\":\"Used by the circuit breaker to calculate price volatility      over the lookback window. Must return the price that was      current at (block.timestamp - secondsAgo), or 0 if unavailable.\",\"params\":{\"secondsAgo\":\"How many seconds back to query\"},\"returns\":{\"_0\":\"price Historical price with 18 decimals, or 0 if unavailable\"}},\"getPrice()\":{\"details\":\"isTrusted covers staleness, sequencer-liveness (on L2s), AND      session-awareness (e.g., equity feeds outside trading windows).      The engine rejects any price where isTrusted == false.\",\"returns\":{\"isTrusted\":\"Whether the price is currently reliable\",\"price\":\"Price in USD with 18 decimals (1e18 = $1.00)\",\"updatedAt\":\"Unix timestamp of the last price update\"}},\"registerFeed(address,address,uint256)\":{\"params\":{\"asset\":\"Collateral token address\",\"feedAddress\":\"Chainlink AggregatorV3Interface proxy address\",\"maxStalenessSeconds\":\"Maximum age before the price is considered stale\"}},\"setL2SequencerFeed(address)\":{\"details\":\"On L2s with a published sequencer feed (Base mainnet, OP, Arbitrum) this      guards against stale prices during sequencer outages. Testnets that do not      publish a sequencer feed can leave this unset \\u2014 the check is skipped.\"}},\"title\":\"ChainlinkAdapter\",\"version\":1},\"userdoc\":{\"kind\":\"user\",\"methods\":{\"SEQUENCER_GRACE_PERIOD()\":{\"notice\":\"Seconds to wait after the sequencer comes back up before trusting prices\"},\"assetFeeds(address)\":{\"notice\":\"collateral asset => price feed configuration (set by owner)\"},\"getHistoricalPrice(uint256)\":{\"notice\":\"Get a historical price from a given number of seconds ago\"},\"getPrice()\":{\"notice\":\"Get the current price and trust status\"},\"l2SequencerFeed()\":{\"notice\":\"Optional L2 Sequencer Uptime Feed (address(0) disables the check)\"},\"marketAssets(address)\":{\"notice\":\"market => collateral asset (set by factory via configure())\"},\"registerFeed(address,address,uint256)\":{\"notice\":\"Register (or update) the Chainlink price feed for a collateral asset\"},\"setL2SequencerFeed(address)\":{\"notice\":\"Set (or clear with address(0)) the L2 Sequencer Uptime Feed\"},\"transferOwner(address)\":{\"notice\":\"Transfer owner role to a new address\"},\"unregisterFeed(address)\":{\"notice\":\"Remove the price feed for a collateral asset\"}},\"notice\":\"Multi-tenant oracle adapter wrapping Chainlink price feeds with L2 sequencer support\",\"version\":1}},\"settings\":{\"compilationTarget\":{\"src/adapters/oracle/ChainlinkAdapter.sol\":\"ChainlinkAdapter\"},\"evmVersion\":\"paris\",\"libraries\":{},\"metadata\":{\"bytecodeHash\":\"ipfs\"},\"optimizer\":{\"enabled\":true,\"runs\":200},\"remappings\":[\":@chainlink/=node_modules/@chainlink/\",\":@eth-optimism/=node_modules/@eth-optimism/\",\":@openzeppelin/=node_modules/@openzeppelin/\",\":@uniswap/=node_modules/@uniswap/\",\":base64-sol/=node_modules/base64-sol/\",\":eth-gas-reporter/=node_modules/eth-gas-reporter/\",\":forge-std/=lib/forge-std/src/\",\":hardhat/=node_modules/hardhat/\"],\"viaIR\":true},\"sources\":{\"node_modules/@chainlink/contracts/src/v0.8/interfaces/AggregatorV3Interface.sol\":{\"keccak256\":\"0xfe4e